{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SwjKRQ66FvWt8mBzWVa6VY","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Prompty - Development Progress\n     2→\n     3→## 2026-02-10 - [US-001] Set up Xcode project with SwiftUI scaffold and folder structure\n     4→- Created Xcode project \"Prompty\" via xcodegen targeting macOS 14.0 (Sonoma), Apple Silicon only (arm64)\n     5→- Swift 5.9+ language version configured (runtime is Swift 6.2.3)\n     6→- Folder structure created: Views/, ViewModels/, Models/, Services/, Persistence/ with .gitkeep files\n     7→- App entry point (PromptyApp.swift) renders an empty window with a placeholder ContentView\n     8→- SwiftLint integrated via Swift Package Manager using SimplyDanny/SwiftLintPlugins (build tool plugin)\n     9→- Build succeeds with zero errors and zero warnings\n    10→- Files changed:\n    11→  - `Prompty/project.yml` - xcodegen project specification\n    12→  - `Prompty/.swiftlint.yml` - SwiftLint configuration\n    13→  - `Prompty/Prompty/PromptyApp.swift` - App entry point\n    14→  - `Prompty/Prompty/Views/ContentView.swift` - Placeholder view\n    15→  - `Prompty/Prompty/Prompty.entitlements` - App sandbox entitlements\n    16→  - `Prompty/Prompty/Assets.xcassets/` - Asset catalogs\n    17→  - `Prompty/Prompty/{Models,ViewModels,Services,Persistence}/.gitkeep` - Folder placeholders\n    18→  - `Prompty/Prompty.xcodeproj/` - Generated Xcode project\n    19→- **Learnings for future iterations:**\n    20→  - xcodegen is used to generate the Xcode project from `project.yml` - run `cd Prompty && xcodegen generate` to regenerate\n    21→  - SwiftLint is integrated as a build tool plugin via `SimplyDanny/SwiftLintPlugins` (version 0.58.2)\n    22→  - Use `-skipPackagePluginValidation` flag with xcodebuild for CI/automated builds\n    23→  - Build command: `xcodebuild -project Prompty.xcodeproj -scheme Prompty -destination 'platform=macOS' -skipPackagePluginValidation build`\n    24→  - The `.swiftlint.yml` config is at `Prompty/.swiftlint.yml` (project root level)\n    25→  - Xcode 26.2 with Swift 6.2.3 is installed\n    26→---\n    27→\n    28→## 2026-02-11 - [US-002] Define data models and SQLite schema\n    29→- Added GRDB.swift v7.4.1 as Swift Package dependency in `project.yml`\n    30→- Created four data models in `Models/`:\n    31→  - `Template` — id (UUID), title (String), description (String?), body (String), folderId (UUID?), createdAt (Date), updatedAt (Date)\n    32→  - `Folder` — id (UUID), name (String), createdAt (Date), updatedAt (Date)\n    33→  - `DataRow` — id (UUID), templateId (UUID), values ([String: String] JSON-encoded), createdAt (Date)\n    34→  - `VersionSnapshot` — id (UUID), templateId (UUID), versionNumber (Int), body (String), note (String?), createdAt (Date)\n    35→- All models conform to GRDB's `FetchableRecord` and `PersistableRecord`\n    36→- `DataRow` has custom `init(row:)` and `encode(to:)` for JSON encoding/decoding the `values` dictionary\n    37→- Created `DatabaseManager` in `Persistence/` with:\n    38→  - Singleton `shared` instance with a `DatabaseQueue`\n    39→  - Database file at `~/Library/Application Support/Prompty/prompty.db`\n    40→  - Migration `v1_createTables` creating all four tables with proper foreign keys\n    41→  - `folderId` on template references folder with `onDelete: .setNull`\n    42→  - `templateId` on dataRow and versionSnapshot references template with `onDelete: .cascade`\n    43→  - Indexes on `templateId` for both `dataRow` and `versionSnapshot` tables\n    44→- Updated `.swiftlint.yml` to exclude `db` and `id` from identifier_name rule\n    45→- Build succeeds with zero errors and zero warnings\n    46→- Files changed:\n    47→  - `Prompty/project.yml` — Added GRDB package dependency\n    48→  - `Prompty/.swiftlint.yml` — Added identifier_name exclusions\n    49→  - `Prompty/Prompty/Models/Template.swift` — Template model\n    50→  - `Prompty/Prompty/Models/Folder.swift` — Folder model\n    51→  - `Prompty/Prompty/Models/DataRow.swift` — DataRow model with JSON encoding\n    52→  - `Prompty/Prompty/Models/VersionSnapshot.swift` — VersionSnapshot model\n    53→  - `Prompty/Prompty/Persistence/DatabaseManager.swift` — Database initializer with migrations\n    54→  - `Prompty/Prompty.xcodeproj/` — Regenerated Xcode project\n    55→- **Learnings for future iterations:**\n    56→  - GRDB v7 uses `primaryKey(\"id\", .text)` syntax for defining primary keys in table creation\n    57→  - Foreign keys use `.references(\"tableName\", onDelete: .cascade)` chained on column definition\n    58→  - UUIDs are stored as `.text` columns in SQLite (GRDB handles UUID <-> String conversion via Codable)\n    59→  - For models with non-trivial encoding (like JSON dictionaries), implement custom `init(row:)` and `encode(to:)` instead of relying on Codable\n    60→  - SwiftLint's `identifier_name` rule flags short names like `db` — add exclusions in `.swiftlint.yml`\n    61→  - App Sandbox automatically grants access to the app's own Application Support container — no additional entitlements needed\n    62→---\n    63→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c4c453f4-e406-444f-b252-33b2bba82642","uuid":"25be5fd6-6291-4ec4-be77-0f170d22d26e","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/kai/github.com/amattn/prompty/progress.md","content":"# Prompty - Development Progress\n\n## 2026-02-10 - [US-001] Set up Xcode project with SwiftUI scaffold and folder structure\n- Created Xcode project \"Prompty\" via xcodegen targeting macOS 14.0 (Sonoma), Apple Silicon only (arm64)\n- Swift 5.9+ language version configured (runtime is Swift 6.2.3)\n- Folder structure created: Views/, ViewModels/, Models/, Services/, Persistence/ with .gitkeep files\n- App entry point (PromptyApp.swift) renders an empty window with a placeholder ContentView\n- SwiftLint integrated via Swift Package Manager using SimplyDanny/SwiftLintPlugins (build tool plugin)\n- Build succeeds with zero errors and zero warnings\n- Files changed:\n  - `Prompty/project.yml` - xcodegen project specification\n  - `Prompty/.swiftlint.yml` - SwiftLint configuration\n  - `Prompty/Prompty/PromptyApp.swift` - App entry point\n  - `Prompty/Prompty/Views/ContentView.swift` - Placeholder view\n  - `Prompty/Prompty/Prompty.entitlements` - App sandbox entitlements\n  - `Prompty/Prompty/Assets.xcassets/` - Asset catalogs\n  - `Prompty/Prompty/{Models,ViewModels,Services,Persistence}/.gitkeep` - Folder placeholders\n  - `Prompty/Prompty.xcodeproj/` - Generated Xcode project\n- **Learnings for future iterations:**\n  - xcodegen is used to generate the Xcode project from `project.yml` - run `cd Prompty && xcodegen generate` to regenerate\n  - SwiftLint is integrated as a build tool plugin via `SimplyDanny/SwiftLintPlugins` (version 0.58.2)\n  - Use `-skipPackagePluginValidation` flag with xcodebuild for CI/automated builds\n  - Build command: `xcodebuild -project Prompty.xcodeproj -scheme Prompty -destination 'platform=macOS' -skipPackagePluginValidation build`\n  - The `.swiftlint.yml` config is at `Prompty/.swiftlint.yml` (project root level)\n  - Xcode 26.2 with Swift 6.2.3 is installed\n---\n\n## 2026-02-11 - [US-002] Define data models and SQLite schema\n- Added GRDB.swift v7.4.1 as Swift Package dependency in `project.yml`\n- Created four data models in `Models/`:\n  - `Template` — id (UUID), title (String), description (String?), body (String), folderId (UUID?), createdAt (Date), updatedAt (Date)\n  - `Folder` — id (UUID), name (String), createdAt (Date), updatedAt (Date)\n  - `DataRow` — id (UUID), templateId (UUID), values ([String: String] JSON-encoded), createdAt (Date)\n  - `VersionSnapshot` — id (UUID), templateId (UUID), versionNumber (Int), body (String), note (String?), createdAt (Date)\n- All models conform to GRDB's `FetchableRecord` and `PersistableRecord`\n- `DataRow` has custom `init(row:)` and `encode(to:)` for JSON encoding/decoding the `values` dictionary\n- Created `DatabaseManager` in `Persistence/` with:\n  - Singleton `shared` instance with a `DatabaseQueue`\n  - Database file at `~/Library/Application Support/Prompty/prompty.db`\n  - Migration `v1_createTables` creating all four tables with proper foreign keys\n  - `folderId` on template references folder with `onDelete: .setNull`\n  - `templateId` on dataRow and versionSnapshot references template with `onDelete: .cascade`\n  - Indexes on `templateId` for both `dataRow` and `versionSnapshot` tables\n- Updated `.swiftlint.yml` to exclude `db` and `id` from identifier_name rule\n- Build succeeds with zero errors and zero warnings\n- Files changed:\n  - `Prompty/project.yml` — Added GRDB package dependency\n  - `Prompty/.swiftlint.yml` — Added identifier_name exclusions\n  - `Prompty/Prompty/Models/Template.swift` — Template model\n  - `Prompty/Prompty/Models/Folder.swift` — Folder model\n  - `Prompty/Prompty/Models/DataRow.swift` — DataRow model with JSON encoding\n  - `Prompty/Prompty/Models/VersionSnapshot.swift` — VersionSnapshot model\n  - `Prompty/Prompty/Persistence/DatabaseManager.swift` — Database initializer with migrations\n  - `Prompty/Prompty.xcodeproj/` — Regenerated Xcode project\n- **Learnings for future iterations:**\n  - GRDB v7 uses `primaryKey(\"id\", .text)` syntax for defining primary keys in table creation\n  - Foreign keys use `.references(\"tableName\", onDelete: .cascade)` chained on column definition\n  - UUIDs are stored as `.text` columns in SQLite (GRDB handles UUID <-> String conversion via Codable)\n  - For models with non-trivial encoding (like JSON dictionaries), implement custom `init(row:)` and `encode(to:)` instead of relying on Codable\n  - SwiftLint's `identifier_name` rule flags short names like `db` — add exclusions in `.swiftlint.yml`\n  - App Sandbox automatically grants access to the app's own Application Support container — no additional entitlements needed\n---\n","numLines":63,"startLine":1,"totalLines":63}}}
