ete with move strategy, delete with cascade strategy\",\n    79→        \"Build succeeds with zero errors\"\n    80→      ],\n    81→      \"description\" : \"As a developer, I want a service to create, read, update, and delete folders in SQLite so that templates can be organized into collections.\",\n    82→      \"id\" : \"US-005\",\n    83→      \"inProgress\" : false,\n    84→      \"passes\" : false,\n    85→      \"priority\" : 5,\n    86→      \"title\" : \"Implement folder CRUD persistence service\"\n    87→    },\n    88→    {\n    89→      \"acceptanceCriteria\" : [\n    90→        \"VersionService class in Services\\/ with methods: createSnapshot, fetchVersions(for templateId), restore(versionId, for templateId)\",\n    91→        \"createSnapshot saves the current template body as a new VersionSnapshot with an auto-incremented versionNumber\",\n    92→        \"fetchVersions returns snapshots ordered by versionNumber descending (newest first)\",\n    93→        \"restore creates a new snapshot (with the restored body) rather than overwriting — non-destructive restore\",\n    94→        \"updateNote(versionId, note) method allows adding\\/editing a note on a snapshot\",\n    95→        \"Unit tests cover: create snapshot, fetch versions ordering, restore creates new version, update note, multiple snapshots for same template\",\n    96→        \"Build succeeds with zero errors\"\n    97→      ],\n    98→      \"description\" : \"As a developer, I want a service to manage version snapshots so that every template save creates a snapshot and users can list, view, and restore previous versions.\",\n    99→      \"id\" : \"US-006\",\n   100→      \"inProgress\" : false,\n   101→      \"passes\" : false,\n   102→      \"priority\" : 6,\n   103→      \"title\" : \"Implement version history persistence service\"\n   104→    },\n   105→    {\n   106→      \"acceptanceCriteria\" : [\n   107→        \"PromptyError enum in Models\\/ with cases for common errors: .temp